"Quests with rewards began only after the Continuance Charter passed, years later."
"After the Charter, mortals can progress toward Questorhood by completing Quests."
"Some Questors seek to unlock Quests for their mortal followers."
"Nine years after the Charter, a Quest box read as the two lines below."
"\"New Quest: Defend Dawn's Concord from the Severance Bloc\""
"\"Reward: Significant progress towards Questorhood.\""
"On success the box read: \"Congratulations! You have successfully defended Dawn's Concord!\""
"Then: \"Reward: Significant progress towards Questorhood\" (with no full stop)."
"Years later the Heirs called themselves half-mortals, partway to Questorhood."
"Some of Sarya's agents are on the path to Questorhood."
